Templates
=========

Starting points for your own labs. Copy one, change the data at the top and run it.

* https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/templates/blank-lab.js: Empty structure with the recommended order
* https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/templates/campus.js: Two distribution switches, access switches, VLANs, HSRP style gateways
* https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/templates/branch-wan.js: Headquarters with branches over serial links and OSPF
* https://github.com/r4chan842/PTForge/blob/main/templates/small-office.js: Edge router with PAT, DHCP, wireless and a server
